{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz02_title", "source_sha256": "0351cb66589345d52dbb650472ef8f3a0e83b34b1a410520d77e9252e7ddf0b9", "ja": "千鶴とおでかけ2", "zh": "和千鹤外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "37cac544ada9e4301379d17c6695ca4c1808438d24a34faeabe93ae2e0847f2e", "ja": "千鶴とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "与千鹤一同外出的情景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "80a6ca60572213332b834ccd27ce500c15e7faf2f9e58816546285c19f127d2c", "ja": "（千鶴さんと一緒に、大崎八幡宮を訪れた。\n伝統を感じる、荘厳な雰囲気だ……）", "zh": "（和千鹤小姐一起参拜了大崎八幡宫。\n庄严的氛围让人感受到了传统……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz02_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "4def5c98d721ffac6e0c5d0d18e52f298a7f691729b76bfd50a1a2500ec1f7ff", "ja": "ふふっ。お参りで、心がより清らかに\nなるような感じがいたしますわね。", "zh": "呵呵。参拜之后，感觉心灵也变得更加纯净了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ae61561d4eedaa6f2fa77b30d1aef7280ade3fff0a69d7c1efb25275b7fbb169", "ja": "ええ。周りの雪のおかげもあってか、\n静かで落ち着いていて……澄んだ気持ちになれました。", "zh": "是的。也许多亏了周围的积雪，这里安静又祥和……让人的心情也变得澄澈了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz02_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "12c42a51ab54a756f46fd8ed9e4259ceb1b9e51eda55497df19a0d33fdfca801", "ja": "{$P$}は、何か、\nお願いごとはされましたの？", "zh": "{$P$}，您许了\n什么愿望吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d4b94a36197f51f34320b1045a38570f33799a54a73f064b272ff93a6e747b77", "ja": "はい。ツアーの成功と、劇場のみんなが、健やかで\nたくさん活躍できますように、と。千鶴さんは？", "zh": "是的。我祈愿巡演成功，也希望剧场的大家都能身体健康、尽情大显身手。千鹤小姐呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz02_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "fce95500e070d82bc920db1dc7672a258b46bb75f6b34a16db4af85c4bdeae4a", "ja": "奇遇ですわね、わたくしも同じですわ。\nこのツアーの成功と、皆の健勝と活躍……。", "zh": "真巧呢，我也一样。\n巡演的成功，以及大家的康健与活跃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz02_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "b0a622fe79763e7b8fb59cb67dd012d6451da24ff84be7a493f31e01062deb29", "ja": "それに実家の商売繁……繁栄と。\nそれから……。", "zh": "还有家里生意的繁……繁荣。然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "103a9ebbd581e46d39009308e3f7e6384840ba6a8145dae1fc6f762fd9259d36", "ja": "それから？", "zh": "然后呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz02_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "3ac9ed00823a10bcf25a149bc66310ff825e87cbd335f14c1436320ffff50a7b", "ja": "貴方と末永く、これからも……\nい、いえ、なんでもありませんわ！？", "zh": "和您长长久久地，今后也……\n不、不，没什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4514ca9cf47624ba24f29356d182473c172f07854301d3d93d8c192a941fe651", "ja": "（その後おみくじを引いたところ、千鶴さんともども\n大吉だった。この幸運を、大切にしていきたいな）", "zh": "（之后抽了签，结果我和千鹤都是大吉。一定要好好珍惜这份幸运啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
